\item{gene_trees}{Compara's gene-tree file, \code{<collection>.GeneTree_content.default.e<release>.txt.gz}.
  It tells a gene whose tree holds no gene of the other species from one whose tree does but got
  no ortholog call.}

\item{dumps}{One Compara homology dump per species
  (\code{homologies/<species>/Compara.<release>.protein_default.homologies.tsv.gz}), in any order: each
  dump's species is read from its rows. Sent on stdin after the species lines.}

\item{gtfs}{A named character vector from species to its Ensembl primary-assembly GTF, plain or
